showing correctly \r\n- [x] Doesn't crash\r\n- [x] With the AdMob plugin, the ads are showing normally, including the NativeAds, [which use resources](https://github.com/poingstudios/godot-admob-plugin/blob/master/platforms/android/src/ads/src/main/res/layout/gnt_medium_template_view.xml)\r\n\r\n\r\nAs I understand it, the bug occurred when the user exported without using Gradle, and it was solved by [disabling `enableResourceOptimizations`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/50665/changes#diff-092e85274587cfa9f328b3337262eed43edc75a8d751a4e1a83df350c9250244R26-R28) in the template release build.\r\n\r\nAnd it was occurring because, without the change, the icon names were changed like this and could not be found for processing:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"520\" height=\"132\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-10 at 22 46 22\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dbde67f1-e3e3-4821-9651-08c858dc1efc\" />\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis issue shouldn't be reopened because [shrinkResources is false](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123234/changes#diff-81aadb220697f9a3dac1980c60648954b1982b9c19cd3629a57c0508dd5b3653R226) and won't shrink assets, just bytecode.\r\n\r\nThanks for reviewing. Please let me know if any new tests are necessary.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5628369182/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5721782061","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123234#issuecomment-5721782061","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123234","id":5721782061,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVQt3LQ","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"",